WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:05.380
Kasia is about to leave and cannot find her keys.

2
00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:09.630
Gdzie są klucze? Przecież leżały na stole.

3
00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:12.320
Chyba zostawiłaś je w samochodzie.

4
00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:18.430
A reproach, then a guess. Neither word adds a fact.

5
00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:22.120
Akurat! Nigdy ich tam nie zostawiam.

6
00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:25.450
Niby nie, a w zeszłym tygodniu?

7
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:28.720
Sarcasm, answered with doubt.

8
00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:34.190
Niby tak, ale nie jestem przekonana.

9
00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:39.590
These small words say how the speaker feels about the sentence.

10
00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:44.740
Remove them and the facts stay the same, but the tone is gone.

11
00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:48.010
Intonation decides the rest.

12
00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:52.210
But I told you.

13
00:00:54.710 --> 00:00:56.470
Przecież ci mówiłem.

14
00:00:57.270 --> 00:01:00.830
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

15
00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:04.390
Przecież ci mówiłem.

16
00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:08.550
You must be joking!

17
00:01:11.050 --> 00:01:12.690
Chyba żartujesz!

18
00:01:13.490 --> 00:01:17.050
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

19
00:01:18.850 --> 00:01:20.490
Chyba żartujesz!

20
00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:26.050
Now practise with the exercises below the video.
